SUMMARY:Grinde på SAL: BUD1 – kap. 2\, s. 48–53 + kap. 3\, s. 56–75
DESCRIPTION:Drury\, Management Accounting for Business (9. utg.)\nKap. 2 An
  introduction to cost terms and concepts:\n  s. 48 The cost and management
  accounting information system\n  s. 49 Summary\n  s. 50 Key terms and con
 cepts\n  s. 51 Assessment material\nKap. 3 Cost-volume-profit analysis:\n 
  s. 56 (kapittelstart)\n  s. 57 Curvilinear CVP relationships\n  s. 58 Lin
 ear CVP relationships\n  s. 60 A numerical approach to cost-volume-profit 
 analysis\n  s. 64 The contribution margin ratio\n  s. 65 Relevant range\n 
  s. 65 Margin of safety\n  s. 66 Constructing the break-even or CVP chart\
 n  s. 67 Alternative presentation of cost-volume-profit analysis\n  s. 70 
 Multi-product cost-volume-profit analysis\n  s. 72 Operating leverage\n  s
 . 74 Cost-volume-profit analysis assumptions and limitations\n\nPensum: ka
 p. 1–10\, 12 og 14–16 (BUD1-plan). Alle kapitler skal være gjennomgå
 tt innen 22.11.
CATEGORIES:BUD1
